================================================================================
Run:      2026-10-23 14:01-14:25 NZDT.  Several supplicants with different MAC
          addresses were driven on one switch port, first with the feature off and then
          with it on.
Bench:    tb277, consoles u2 (swi_d); Test Engineer bidhanc@bidhanc-dl
Tester:   bench-runner
Graded:   tester
Case:     AWPTCM-T33360.  The case record holds no objective and no steps.  The six
          steps below were designed for this bench.  On AlliedWare Plus the feature
          named "Multiple Authentication" is `auth host-mode multi-supplicant`: several
          supplicants, each with its own MAC address, authenticating on one port.
