STEP 0 -- baseline, single-host: two supplicants, only one may get in     done
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: send two supplicants with good passwords while the port is still in its
  default `single-host` mode.  Both are declared `expect=success` on purpose, so the
  tool, and not the tester, states that the baseline admits only one.  Sent after
  `dot1x initialize interface port1.0.48`.

awplus# show dot1x interface port1.0.48
  portStatus: Unauthorized
  hostMode: single-host                          <-- the OFF state for this case

awplus#configure terminal
awplus(config)#radius-server local
awplus(config-radsrv)#user ckmulti1 password ckmulti1pw
awplus(config-radsrv)#user ckmulti2 password ckmulti2pw
                                                 <-- accepted, no "% " line;
                                                     `show radius local-server user`
                                                     then read Total users: 4

